'''Li'l Macho Legs Cat''' (ちびムキあしネコ ''Chibi Muki Ashi Neko'', '''Chibi Muscular Legs Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Creeper (Deadly)|Li'l Gross Awakens!]] It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name= Li'l Macho Legs Cat
|image = E 325.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Creeper (Deadly)|Li'l Gross Awakens!]]
[[Path to +55|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 810¢ - 3,199¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is very similar to [[Crazed Gross Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Gross Cat]] in terms of attack methods: it kicks up a powerful [[Wave Attack]] and pushes through. Handle it with a stack of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborgs]] and an [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] but be sure to keep out of its reach as this enemy's waves can hit cats from very far away, potentially disrupting the rate of Paris Cats coming in.[[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)| Lone Cat and Kitten]] can knockback and freeze Li'l Macho Legs, allowing Bahamut Cat to land in more hits.

